# Rust build lockfile — this crate is a library, so we do not commit
# Cargo.lock at the crate root. Anchored to the crate root with a
# leading slash so the conventional `fuzz/Cargo.lock` (a separate,
# non-published cargo-fuzz binary crate) CAN be committed.
/Cargo.lock

# Cargo-fuzz build + corpus artefacts. The harness sources under
# `fuzz/fuzz_targets/` ARE committed; build artefacts and accumulated
# corpora / crash artefacts are not.
/fuzz/target
/fuzz/corpus
/fuzz/artifacts
